item.shield_controller.description=Shield Controller protects armor from ALL forms of damage - including atmospheric corrosion!
item.volcanic_pickaxe.description=Mines a 3x3 area depending on which direction you are facing
tile.beam_receiver.description=Beam Receivers are connected to energy machine input and output, to transfer energy using beams.
tile.beam_reflector.description=Beam Reflectors are used to redirect energy beams from source to destination. Can be right-clicked to cycle through targets.
tile.cavern_vines.description=Cavernous Vines are dangerous to living creatures, entangling them and dragging them upwards.
tile.creeper_egg.description=Creeper Eggs will spawn in Mars dungeons, spawning a sneaky predator upon exploding.
tile.cryo_chamber.description=Cryogenic Chambers will allow a player to sleep during the day, healing a small amount of health, but has a cooldown.
tile.electrolyzer.description=Transforms water into hydrogen (useful for the Methane Synthesizer) and oxygen.
tile.gas_liquefier.description=Liquefies gases, either from the atmosphere or from canisters. Liquefied methane makes a good rocket fuel!
tile.geothermal_generator.description=When placed on a valid sulfur vapor spout, generates energy at an oscillating rate
tile.hydrogen_pipe.description=Hydrogen Pipe will transfer hydrogen from one machine's internal gas tank to another.
tile.launch_controller.description=Launch Controllers are used to customize launch behavior, including launch criteria and destination launch pad for auto launches.
tile.laser_turret.description=Can target meteors, players, and mobs
tile.methane_synthesizer.description=With a source of hydrogen and a source of carbon, this manufactures Methane for further processing in a Gas Liquefier.
tile.miner_base.description=The Astro Miner Base is the docking point for an Astro Miner.  It's big ... try making a 2 x 2 x 2 cube with these.
tile.slimeling_egg.description=Slimeling Eggs, once cracked with a player's bare hands, will soon hatch into a pet.
tile.solar_array_controller.description=Connect Solar Array Modules to this block to provide power. Most effective on space stations.
tile.solar_array_module.description=Connect several of these blocks to a Solar Array Controller to provide power. Most effective on space stations.
tile.telepad_short.description=Short Range Telepads are used to transfer players and other living creatures short distances (250 Blocks) when linked to other telepads.
tile.terraformer.description=Terraformers are used to add some greenery to distant planets, adding grass, trees and water when given the correct materials.
tile.treasure_t2.description=Tier 2 Treasure Chests will generate in Mars Dungeons. They are unlockable after defeating the final boss.
tile.treasure_t3.description=Tier 3 Treasure Chests will generate in Venus Dungeons. They are unlockable after defeating the final boss.
tile.walkway.walkway.description=Walkways are used for decorative purposes, used for connecting blocks while maintaining a space theme.
tile.walkway.walkway_pipe.description=Fluid Pipe Walkways are used for running pipes underneath a fully walkable surface.
tile.walkway.walkway_wire.description=Aluminum Wire Walkways are used for running wire underneath a fully walkable surface.
